Cause mapping for block record: predStatus ROLLED_BACK → cause "ROLLBACK"; WINDOW_EXPIRED → "WINDOW_EXPIRED"; DEPENDENCY_BLOCKED → "DEPENDENCY_BLOCKED".

"首个阻断来源集合" — since only APPROVED members get blocked (once), block records are written exactly once per member. Good.

