**Fingerprint**: 
```java
private String fingerprint(PublishBatchRequest req, List<BatchEdgeRef> edges) {
    List<Object> parts = new ArrayList<>();
    parts.add("PUBLISH_BATCH");
    parts.add(req.batchId());
    parts.add(req.publishedAt());
    for (BatchMemberRef m : sortedMembers) { parts.add(m.requestId()); parts.add(m.expectedVersion()); }
    for (BatchEdgeRef e : sortedEdges) { parts.add(e.predecessor()); parts.add(e.successor()); }
    return FingerprintUtil.sha256(parts.toArray());
}
```
Sorted canonical — structured JSON array, unambiguous with separator-containing text. Good.

Note: FingerprintUtil's ObjectMapper has JavaTimeModule — LocalDateTime serializes fine.

